  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Girls not Brides 2017 - 2019 - Girls not Brides</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Girls not Brides 2017 - 2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">From Girls not Brides&apos; strategy 2017-2020 (the Global Partnership to end Child Marriage):  The VISION is a world without child marriage where girls and women enjoy equal status with boys and men and are able to achieve their full potential in all aspects of their lives.  The Global Partnership brings together over 700 civil society organisations in more than 85 countries. As members, the MISSION is to join together to accelerate efforts to prevent child marriage, and to support girls who are or have been married, all over the world.  The STRATEGY identifies a set of six shared goals which aim to focus the work as a Partnership and maximise impact for the four year period 2017-2020. They relate to governments taking action to address child marriage, that international and regional actors support implementation of commitments, that efforts to engage communities, families and girls are supported and highlighted, that more sustainable funding is available, that efforts to address child marriage are based on data and evidence and finally that the partnership continues to collaborate, diversify and strengthen.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Girls not Brides is a global partnership to end child marriage.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det till Girls Not Brides &#xe4;r en ny insats med fokus p&#xe5; prevention av barn&#xe4;ktenskap. Girls not Brides &#xe4;r ett globalt partnersskap med &#xf6;ver 700 medlemmar (NGOs) &#xf6;ver hela v&#xe4;rlden (ca 85 l&#xe4;nder). Sekretariatet finns i London. Partnerskapet har utarbetat en gemensam strategi f&#xf6;r att arbeta p&#xe5; global niv&#xe5; och p&#xe5; nationell niv&#xe5; med regeringar, organisationer och lokala samh&#xe4;llen. GNBs ansats &#xe4;r multisektoriell och g&#xf6;r tydliga l&#xe4;nkar till utbildning, h&#xe4;lsa (inklusive SRHR) och r&#xe4;ttssektorn. Oj&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet, fattigdom och diskriminering av flickor anses vara fr&#xe4;msta grundorsaker till barn&#xe4;ktenskap.</narrative>
  </description>
